@startuml sequence-digitalizer-title-page
!include elvira.iuml
' =============================================================================
' What: title, authors, publisher and year prefilled from the title page
'       (evilflowers-books-digitalizer#15): after analyze, the orchestrator ranks
'       hOCR line candidates of the first and last leaves and asks the text decider
'       one choice per field; the operator confirms in the SPA, which alone writes
'       the item metadata and records a labelled case (#7).
' Kind: UML sequence diagram, one scenario (a full run, then the operator).
'       Omitted: SSE, telemetry, the IA export.
' Source: this repo studio/title_page.py, studio/workers/stages/title_page.py,
'         studio/application/title_page.py, studio/api/routes.py (2026-11-16);
'         knowledge Cookbooks/Deploy-Decision-Models (decider contract, model
'         multilingual); knowledge#77 (DECIDER_URL, written, not applied).
' =============================================================================

title Title page: suggestions from OCR lines, confirmed by the operator (implemented, 2026-11-16)

actor "Operator" as op
participant "SPA\nbook screen" as spa
participant "Portal API" as api
participant "Orchestrator\n(job ledger)" as orch <<focus>>
database "postgresql18\ndb digitalizer" as pg
collections "Shared storage\n{storage_root}" as fs
participant "decider (Laya)\n(namespace shared)" as dec <<proposed>>

orch -> pg : last analyze job applied -> plan analyze/title_page (local)
group analyze/title_page (digitalizer.local.title_page)
  orch -> fs : hOCR of the first 4 and last 2 leaves
  orch -> orch : lines with size and position; rank per field
  loop title, authors, publisher, year
    orch -[$accent_msg()]> dec : <b>POST /v1/systemone choice</b>\n<b>criteria: top 12 line ids + none · state: the lines</b>
    dec --> orch : choice, p, model
  end
  orch -> pg : books.metadata_suggestions (never item_metadata)
end
op -> spa : open the book
spa -> api : GET /books/{id}/title-page
api -> pg : suggestions with p
op -> spa : edit, Confirm
spa -> api : POST /books/{id}/title-page/confirm
api -> pg : item_metadata (validated) + metadata_confirmed\n(accepted / changed / none per field)

caption Fail soft: without DECIDER_URL, or when a call fails, nothing is suggested and the run goes on.\nEvery confirmed form is a title_page case in labelling mode's JSONL export (evilflowers-books-digitalizer#7).
footer ELVIRA · FIIT STU · evilflowers-books-digitalizer · docs/diagrams/sequence-digitalizer-title-page.puml
@enduml
